@startuml
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
participant "SGW-C" as SGWC
participant "PGW-C" as PGWC
participant "PGW-U" as PGWU
participant "PCRF" as PCRF
participant "AF" as AF
participant "OCS" as OCS

== Event Detection ==
SGWC -> PGWC: GTPv2: Modify Bearer Request (new RAT type)

== Gx PCC Rule Request ==
PGWC -> PCRF: Diameter (Gx): Credit-Control-Request (CCR-U)
opt AF subscribed to the event
    PCRF -> AF: Diameter (Rx): Re-Auth-Request (RAR)
    AF -> PCRF: Diameter (Rx): Re-Auth-Answer (RAA)
end
note over PCRF: PCC rule and policy decision
PCRF -> PGWC: Diameter (Gx): Credit-Control-Answer (CCA-U)

== Gy Credit Re-authorization ==
opt Online charging applies and a re-authorization trigger is armed
    PGWC -> OCS: Diameter (Gy): Credit-Control-Request (CCR-U)
    OCS -> PGWC: Diameter (Gy): Credit-Control-Answer (CCA-U)
end

== User Plane Update ==
opt PCC rules or authorized QoS changed
    PGWC -> PGWU: PFCP: Session Modification Request
    PGWU -> PGWC: PFCP: Session Modification Response
end

== IP-CAN Session Response ==
PGWC -> SGWC: GTPv2: Modify Bearer Response
@enduml
